# The .mos package is consumed by MOS as an archive and built into a Linux
# container. Line endings must not depend on the contributor's platform or
# core.autocrlf setting: CRLF in a Dockerfile or entrypoint.sh breaks the build
# or the container's shell.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
